{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And Balaam son of Beor, the sorcerer</b> — teaches that they brought him before Moses and judged him by the law of <i>a sorceress you shall not let live</i>. <b>There is a way that seems straight to a man, but its end is ways of death</b> (Proverbs 14:12). <b>There is a way straight</b> — ראשי תיבות עולה כ\"ד, וסוף טיבות שכר. שכר — כ\"ד thousand, that he caused to fall from Israel by his counsel."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:30.352317389Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}